{"text": "吃完留下的香蕉皮，分类投放时算作湿垃圾。", "group": "香蕉皮", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 5, "end": 8, "text": "香蕉皮", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 16, "end": 19, "text": "湿垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "纸箱要是没有被弄脏，就可以作为可回收物处理。", "group": "纸箱", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "text": "纸箱", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 15, "end": 19, "text": "可回收物", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "这支含汞温度计已经坏了，应交到有害垃圾收集处。", "group": "含汞温度计", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 2, "end": 7, "text": "含汞温度计", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 15, "end": 19, "text": "有害垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "用过的纸巾即使看着干净，也应该放进干垃圾桶。", "group": "用过的纸巾", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "text": "用过的纸巾", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 17, "end": 20, "text": "干垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "把矿泉水瓶扔进可回收物桶之前，要先倒空。", "group": "矿泉水瓶", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 1, "end": 5, "text": "矿泉水瓶", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 7, "end": 11, "text": "可回收物", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "今天整理出了旧毛衣，可以投放到可回收物收集点。", "group": "旧毛衣", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 6, "end": 9, "text": "旧毛衣", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 15, "end": 19, "text": "可回收物", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "茶叶渣沥水后归到湿垃圾这一类。", "group": "茶叶渣", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "茶叶渣", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 8, "end": 11, "text": "湿垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "胶带既不能回收也不易腐烂，按干垃圾处理即可。", "group": "胶带", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "text": "胶带", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 14, "end": 17, "text": "干垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "废油漆不能乱倒，其分类应为有害垃圾。", "group": "废油漆", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "废油漆", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 13, "end": 17, "text": "有害垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "BELONGS_TO"}
{"text": "处理苹果皮，请先沥干水分并去除包装。", "group": "苹果皮", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 2, "end": 5, "text": "苹果皮", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 8, "end": 17, "text": "沥干水分并去除包装", "type": "METHOD"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "DISPOSE_WITH"}
{"text": "为了避免划伤，玻璃杯在丢弃前需包裹尖锐边角。", "group": "玻璃杯", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 7, "end": 10, "text": "玻璃杯", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 15, "end": 21, "text": "包裹尖锐边角", "type": "METHOD"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "DISPOSE_WITH"}
{"text": "旧床单若准备回收，应尽量保持清洁干燥。", "group": "旧床单", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "旧床单", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 12, "end": 18, "text": "保持清洁干燥", "type": "METHOD"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "DISPOSE_WITH"}
{"text": "将过期药片交给收集点时，请连同包装单独投放。", "group": "过期药片", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 1, "end": 5, "text": "过期药片", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 13, "end": 21, "text": "连同包装单独投放", "type": "METHOD"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "DISPOSE_WITH"}
{"text": "废荧光灯管请勿敲碎，需要保持完整并单独投放。", "group": "废荧光灯管", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "text": "废荧光灯管", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 12, "end": 21, "text": "保持完整并单独投放", "type": "METHOD"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "DISPOSE_WITH"}
{"text": "有人认为香蕉皮可以放入干垃圾，实际并非如此。", "group": "香蕉皮", "template": "challenge", "provenance": "authored_paraphrase_challenge", "entities": [{"start": 4, "end": 7, "text": "香蕉皮", "type": "ITEM"}, {"start": 11, "end": 14, "text": "干垃圾", "type": "CATEGORY"}], "head": 0, "tail": 1, "relation": "NO_RELATION"}
